                                    "npc": "Erm, no, that's just, erm, paint. Yes, paint! That's what it is!"
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "player": "Oh, okay. Thanks. Bye."
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "npc": "Ha, gullible fool."
                                  },
                                  {
